# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Likelink — Environment Variables
# Copy to .env for local dev, and add every variable to Vercel:
#   Project Settings → Environment Variables (add for Production + Preview)
# NOTE: variables prefixed with VITE_ are public (baked into the JS bundle).
#       Never put a secret in a VITE_ variable.
# NOTE: changing any VITE_ variable requires a fresh Deploy to take effect.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1. Supabase (REQUIRED — client bundle AND all /api serverless functions) ─
# Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API. Use the anon/public key, NOT service_role.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# Server-side key for the /api workers (payouts, autopilot, price-watch, push).
# Optional but strongly recommended: bypasses Row Level Security so crons can
# always read/write the shared kv store. NEVER prefix this with VITE_.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key

# ── 2. Admin panel access code (REQUIRED) ────────────────────────────────────
# Keep it long & random. If omitted, the admin panel stays locked.
VITE_ADMIN_CODE=replace-with-a-long-random-string

# ── 3. Cron worker secrets (RECOMMENDED — protects the /api cron endpoints) ──
# Anyone can hit these endpoints with ?secret=... — pick long random strings.
# Vercel's own cron scheduler authenticates via the x-vercel-cron header, so
# these are only needed for manual/rerun triggers.
# PAYOUTS_SECRET=long-random-string
# PRICE_WATCH_SECRET=long-random-string
# AUTOPILOT_SECRET=long-random-string

# ── 4. PayPal payouts (OPTIONAL — real money only when both are set) ─────────
# PayPal Developer → Apps & Credentials → Live (or Sandbox) → REST API app.
# Without these, PayPal payouts are skipped gracefully (status stays "failed"
# with a clear note; bank/other payout methods are unaffected).
# PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=your-paypal-client-id
# PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET=your-paypal-client-secret
# Force production endpoint even if the secret contains the word "sandbox":
# PAYPAL_ENV=live

# ── 5. Autopilot AI polish (OPTIONAL) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Without it, Autopilot uses its built-in Hebrew caption engine (no cost).
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ── 6. Google Merchant Center feed overrides (OPTIONAL) ──────────────────────
# Used by /api/google-feed and `npm run feed:google`. Defaults shown.
# LIKELINK_BASE_URL=https://likelink.com
# LIKELINK_CURRENCY=ILS
# LIKELINK_BRAND=Likelink

